\paragraph{Performance across ID and OOD.}
GRL-SNAM maintains near-perfect success on both Test-ID and Test-OOD and achieves the highest SPL with low variance.
By contrast, full-map planners are either conservative (inflation-induced detours) or sensitive to hand-tuned deformation costs, and stagewise reactive methods (PF/CBF/DWA) degrade on Test-OOD due to local oscillations, stalls, or cul-de-sac behavior.

